{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-04T08:43:07.181Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary:\n\n**Deliverable:** `osq --help` now prints the commands in four groups, everyday first.\n\n**Files changed (within scope):**\n- `src/cli/help-groups.ts` (new) — exports `COMMAND_GROUPS`, `BARE_OSQ_LINE`, and `configureGroupedHelp`. The root formatter uses commander's own `Help` methods for every row (so terms/wrapping stay identical), prints the bare-osq line between the description and options, then the four `<title> commands:` groups, with an `Other commands:` fallback. Non-root commands fall back to `Help.prototype.formatHelp`.\n- `src/cli/index.ts` — calls `configureGroupedHelp(program)` after the last command is registered (241 lines, under the 250 budget).\n- `tests/help-groups.test.ts` (new) — covers every acceptance line.\n\n**Verification:**\n- Task verify `node --import tsx --test tests/help-groups.test.ts` → 8/8 pass.\n- Proposal verify `pnpm verify` → typechecks, build, full suite, and lint all pass.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/145-help-everyday-first/.run/results/1.md`."}}
